{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23380","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和我年三首 三 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和我年三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我年五十七，荣名得非少。\n报国竟何如，谋身犹未了。\n昔尝速官谤，恩大而惩小。\n一黜鹤辞轩，七年鱼在沼。\n将枯鳞再跃，经铩翮重矫。\n白日上昭昭，青云高渺渺。\n平生颇同病，老大宜相晓。\n紫绶足可荣，白头不爲夭。\n夙怀慕箕颍，晚节期松筱。\n何当阙下来，同拜陈情表。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}